                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "It\u0027s rare to find such a good hot pot restaurant in this area!\n\nNext time my friends come over, we won\u0027t have to go all the way to Jingmei Night Market to find something to eat. Perfect for group meals!\n\nAffordable hot pot, delicious food! All-you-can-eat buffet! The soft serve ice cream is pretty good! And the prices aren\u0027t expensive either. Thumbs up! Highly recommend this place!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "難得有個好吃的火鍋店在這區\n下次朋友來終於不用再跑去景美夜市才有東西吃 聚餐\n\n平價火鍋 東西好吃\n自助吧吃到飽\n霜淇淋蠻不錯的\n價格也不貴 讚讚 推薦好店",
